#: ../../../integration/ide/cloud9.rst:15
msgid "Cloud9"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ide/cloud9.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Cloud9 <https://c9.io/>`_ combines a powerful online code editor with a "
"full Ubuntu workspace in the cloud. Workspaces are powered by Docker Ubuntu "
"containers that give you full freedom over your environment, including sudo "
"rights. Do a git push, compile SASS, see server output, and Run apps easily "
"with the built-in Terminal and Runners."
msgstr ""

